  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: motivational; overall-intent-description: The image shows a diverse group of five smiling, athletic-looking individuals sitting on concrete stairs. The text overlay poses motivational questions: 'what do you want to do?' with the answer 'win!!' and 'when do you want to do it?' with the answer 'now!'. The overall intent is to inspire action and encourage immediate pursuit of goals. There is no toxicity present in the image. The visual of fit, smiling people combined with the text creates an uplifting, motivational message aimed at encouraging viewers to take initiative and strive for success. The meme uses positive reinforcement and a call to action without targeting any specific group or using harmful stereotypes.",
